Signed-off-by: Sasha Levin <sashal@kernel.org>
Signed-off-by: Jiri Slaby <jslaby@suse.cz>
---
 rust/zerocopy-derive/README.md | 2 +-
 rust/zerocopy/README.md        | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

